n when there's a  communication break down or there's like  a language barrier they can help you get  through that by telling you oh in this  situation we say this whatever so you  learn how to deal with those unexpected  natural situations that come up in real  conversations that you won't get on the  Pimsleur CD so you need to supplement  you need the visual input and you also  need that free practice and if you do  though all those things in conjunction  with the Pimsleur then you're going to  come out with a really strong base and  when you're done the courses you'll be  ready to get into some simple  conversations and then build more and  more on top of that so PIMs was good the  price I don't know what to say about it  but try to get your hands on them use  them but supplement it's not the only  thing to use but it's good

